{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18817","headline":"詶牛相公独饮偶醉寓言见示 · 刘禹锡","name":"詶牛相公独饮偶醉寓言见示","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宫漏夜丁丁，千门闭霜月。\n华堂列红烛，丝管静中发。\n歌眉低有思，舞体轻无骨。\n主人啓酡颜，酣畅浃肌髪。\n犹思城外客，阡陌不可越。\n春意日夕深，此欢无断绝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18817.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18817","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}